{"reviews":[{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-0","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and good material","x":"So many colors to choose from! I love them but the only complaint I have is that one of the roses arrived without the clip (the red one) so I had to glue it back with crazy glue since I don\u2019t have a heat gun but it worked as it stuck to it and hasn\u2019t fallen off again.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-1","r":5.0,"t":"High Quality flowers","x":"I really liked these flowers. They have a clip and a pin. Used them for a themed party. I wore one the whole party for 6 hrs without any issue.They have a nice soft texture. They do not look cheap plastic ones that you can find everywhere.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-2","r":5.0,"t":"Beautiful and look real","x":"Absolutely love - such a wide variety and so delicate looking.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-3","r":5.0,"t":"I love these flowers!","x":"Beautiful flowers!!!!  I get compliments everywhere that I go!","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-4","r":3.0,"t":"They are ok","x":"These are very pretty and well made. They came in a plastic bag which was disappointing because the leaves are bent. And they don\u2019t lay flat when you put them in your hair. That\u2019s a little disappointing but I will keep them. I wear hair decoration all the time and I gave the flowers a 3 because of the packaging and the fact that they don't lay flat. The colors are good. Accurate per the description.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-5","r":5.0,"t":"Fantastic quality, Great selection of colors.","x":"I bought these because I frequently wear my hair up in the summer and like to do pin-up styles or at least dress up a messy bun with a flower or two. These are perfect for that. The quality is very nice, better that I expected for the price. There is a great variety of colors and the clips are very sturdy. I will definitely order again.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-6","r":5.0,"t":"Great value!!!","x":"They are beautiful! I put one in my hair right away.  They are very well made , good material and workmanship. And I needed so many of these colors...the colors are exactly the ones shown! In love:)","h":3,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-7","r":5.0,"t":"Detailed hair flowers!","x":"Super detailed flowers! Makes my vintage hair styles stand out even more! Love these when I do victory rolls! Adds just a little extra cuteness!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2020"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-8","r":4.0,"t":"Colors are lovely, but doesn't work with my thin hair!","x":"Colors are lovely, but doesn't work with my thin hair!  These would be great for corsages because they're more imitation flower looking. I'm a good bit older than most, and very thin hair. The safety pin that you would click on your clothes, kind of pulls out my hair when I'm putting in then taking out. I will give these to somebody they're quite nice!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-9","r":5.0,"t":"beautiful flowers","x":"I love that these are bright and colorful. The pins on the back keep them in place in my hair. but they are challenging to remove without ripping my hair since the claw has teeth. I am happy with my purchase and hope the best for my hair.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-10","r":4.0,"t":"pretty, easy, great colors","x":"My hair is growing back after chemo....in the meantime i pull it back and put a couple of flowers on the back....sort if like a bun....it works","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-11","r":5.0,"t":"Well worth the money","x":"I am living in two places and have lots of decorative hair and jacket flowers at my other home. I ordered these and they were well beyond my expectations. Perfect and definately worth the money. The quality is excellent.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2020"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-12","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful but too large for hair","x":"Bought them to wear in my hair, but the size is too big to be worn in the hair.  Great variety of colors.  Going to hold on to them in case can wear as a pin or brooch.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-13","r":5.0,"t":"Nice 10 piece set","x":"Very pretty! I used all of them for a dia de los muertos costume. Light enough to wear every day. For the price to gat all 10 pieces is great!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great value for all you get","x":"Bought 1 years ago and recently lost one. Was happy to see this time more then one at such a great price. All flowers are so pretty.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2022"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-15","r":5.0,"t":"Quality","x":"Very good quality compared to others I have purchased in the past. Would order again if needed.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-16","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!!!!!","x":"They r great!!!! I have gotten so many compliments from them!!!!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good deal, soft fabric.","x":"Nice variety of colors. All have a pin and clip attachment.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2020"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-18","r":5.0,"t":"Very pretty","x":"Despite one flower that was no longer glued to the pin/clip, this is a great value. They appear a little squished in their package. I laid them out on a table for a couple of days and they \u201cpoofed\u201d. Being able to use as a hair clip or pin makes these a true value. Recommend if use as a pin, to use a safety pin and then pin this to the safety pin.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2021"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-19","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful colors and great for multiple uses","x":"These flowers came in beautiful colors.  They are perfect for attaching to headbands or clothing.  The back of the flowers have both a pin and a clip.  My only issue is that the flower was a little heavy for the clip, and kept wanting to droop.  I think it could possibly be fixed with a little glue.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-20","r":4.0,"t":"Beautiful but burned","x":"All flowers were beautiful but ome was burned with a whole on the petals I just trimmed it and it looked fine .. also due to heat the hot glue that attached the backs came apart probably due to heat while shipping I just took the old glue off put more hot glue and attached the back on again","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-21","r":3.0,"t":"A few were broken.","x":"These obviously aren't made well, a few (of course the ones I would most want to wear) were broken and detached on arrival. I can fix them, but defeats the purpose of buying them already put together.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2022"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-22","r":1.0,"t":"Good if you only plan on using once...","x":"After wearing about 1/2 of the flowers I have discovered the the glue they use is made from water... they don\u2019t stick were they should. After one wear you will be gluing them back together again.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2019"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-23","r":3.0,"t":"Cute, simple flowers.","x":"Great amount for the price.  Flowers are very obviously fake without a lot of depth of colors. However for craft projects these would be great to dress up.  Great for hair. Nice size.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2021"},{"id":"B07DCJSKL5-24","r":4.0,"t":"Get what you pay for","x":"A little hard and paper-like in texture but otherwise cute and fairly large. Would be perfect for something like a costume but maybe not a wedding.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"May 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently describe the flowers as beautiful and pretty.","cites":[1,3,4,5,7,10,13,14,15]},{"text":"Many praise the quality, material, and workmanship as good or better than expected.","cites":[1,2,6,7,12]},{"text":"Customers appreciate the wide variety of colors available.","cites":[1,6,7,9,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers find the clips/pins hold well in hair, though some note they can pull or rip hair when removing.","cites":[2,9,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention sizing or packaging issues, such as flowers being too large for hair or arriving bent in a plastic bag.","cites":[5,13]}]},"qa":[]}